305
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:53,000
You made

306
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:55,000
mistakes along the way, You tried

307
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:57,000
some things out that weren't a very good idea

308
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:59,000
and it's very

309
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:01,000
tempting as an adult to watch

310
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:03,000
these guys try to do something and want

311
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:05,000
to fix it for them or want to

312
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:07,000
