00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:21,000
if you aren't over there poking your nose in it.

320
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:23,000
Number nine: we do our best

321
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:25,000
to give our older scouts plenty of time to spend

322
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:27,000
with each other. We have

323
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:29,000
an expectation that they work actively

324
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:31,000
with younger scouts, but we

325
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:33,000
want to also make sure that they get to hang

326
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:35,000
out with their friends. I mean, that's one

327
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:37,000
of the big reasons that they're there.

