00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:35,000
occasions. And as with

387
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:37,000
any of these methods of scouting,

388
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:39,000
I can't force a boy to wear

389
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:41,000
uniform. I encourage him. I set

390
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:43,000
an example by wearing my own,

391
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:45,000
but I won't force him. I don't

392
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:47,000
force boys to participate in the

393
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:49,000
outdoor program. I encourage them.

394
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:51,000
I set an example by going myself,

395
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:53,000
but I'm not going to force them to do

396
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:55,000
that. I don't force boys to use

397
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:57,000
the patrol system. I encourage them,

398
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:59,000
but I won't force them. I don't force

399
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:01,000
them to work with younger scouts.

400
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:03,000
I encourage them. I set the example

401
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:05,000
by working with them. I don't

402
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:07,000
force scouts to do their job.

403
00:20:07,000 --> 00:20:09,000
They take on a position of

404
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:11,000
setting an example by being responsible,

405
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:13,000
but I can't force them to be

406
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:15,000
responsible, nor will I try.

407
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:17,000
Scouting is not about

408
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:19,000
scouts meeting my

