voluntarily. They aren't there to

413
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:29,000
do as they're told and to toe the

414
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:31,000
line. They're there to build

415
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:33,000
something for and about themselves.

416
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:35,000
I won't force.

